-- sandhya  07/08/06    #8464  --  Truncated vendor name columns to 20 char and added error logging\r
-- Hema     07/17/06    #8759 -- Modified error messages and ADDED EXCEP MESSAGE FOR ADDRESS TYPE\r
-- Hema     07/24/06    #8759 -- Modified Exceptional Messages to add county name, provider and client name\r
-- Hema     08/01/06    #8759 -- Modified county code to county name\r
