-- Sandhya - 08/29/2007 -- #15672 - REMOVED DISTINCT FROM THE CURSOR DUE TO SINGLE RECORDS IN THE ERROR LOG TABLE check payid : 46706 in reportsdb\r
-- Sandhya - 08/29/2007 -- #15672 - Added condition for validating Final Amount.  Check if Final Amt is null along with the check final amt =0\r
-- sandhya - 06/04/2008 -  COUNTY ROLL-UP\r
